  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "——爲魯迅先生三週年祭而作",
      "output_sha256": "2842fdabaa146cbf866fa60b49b2f07798b2ad6d41ef637bcaa2bd54884ac2d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "2842fdabaa146cbf866fa60b49b2f07798b2ad6d41ef637bcaa2bd54884ac2d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "青年人寫信，寫得太草率，魯迅先生是深惡痛絕之的。",
      "output_sha256": "c95dd7e3c49f36dfdc1176b24467cca2763fe6b75b55176024c854687a5931f2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "c95dd7e3c49f36dfdc1176b24467cca2763fe6b75b55176024c854687a5931f2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“字不一定要寫得好，但必須得使人一看了就認識，年輕人現在都太忙了……他自己趕快胡亂寫完了事，別人看了三遍五遍看不明白，這費了多少工夫，他不管。",
      "output_sha256": "81439c1b302068fe2be4105fc913631557206c56f1c04a520bd9a779f48e6bae",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "81439c1b302068fe2be4105fc913631557206c56f1c04a520bd9a779f48e6bae",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "反正那些工夫不是他們的，這樣的心態實在不好。”",
      "output_sha256": "578e5f5325d2239562429e00ed663b5c19f6016758f426502562cc9b3e6e44b8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.55125,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4,
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e74944f7dc0e60b261f7a6dfe9a89e0b27e6d2a4a2ac0e559cfdb933e3ad29ad",
        "26b5893ce6f83a4d6ffc8e7629c243636ddf8caffa92dd86f522decd509995fc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "578e5f5325d2239562429e00ed663b5c19f6016758f426502562cc9b3e6e44b8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "儘管如此，他仍然仔細閱讀每一封從不同地方寄來的年輕人的信。",
      "output_sha256": "dc3a322b56b1c0fa2c25956d2ccdc393804a3d1b4bbecba3204a28e8b8e679fb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.457458,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "10a4a603d450a1de0e26c97b80cafeff6d9f763894575cfcdfcc4dca5305af91"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dc3a322b56b1c0fa2c25956d2ccdc393804a3d1b4bbecba3204a28e8b8e679fb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "當眼睛感到疲倦時，他便戴上眼鏡，常常看到深夜時分。",
      "output_sha256": "1b375cae0c6135ccc5e061cc3f5d72ff06dd7a654cf39e36df79a1f72ab3997a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.457458,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "10a4a603d450a1de0e26c97b80cafeff6d9f763894575cfcdfcc4dca5305af91"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1b375cae0c6135ccc5e061cc3f5d72ff06dd7a654cf39e36df79a1f72ab3997a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "珂勒惠支的畫，魯迅先生最佩服，同時也很佩服她的做人，珂勒惠支受希特拉的壓迫，不准她做教授，不准她畫畫，魯迅先生常講到她。",
      "output_sha256": "1d819c7d06501ed5220265f6d9ea8c68575e570f0b270b9b6ba42c7e9ebd8c94",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "1d819c7d06501ed5220265f6d9ea8c68575e570f0b270b9b6ba42c7e9ebd8c94",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "史沫特烈，魯迅先生也講到，她是美國女子，幫助印度獨立運動，現在又在援助中國。",
      "output_sha256": "983e77530b90e418e14e92bbc210c28eee77fedf642a0050e64d65809f54489b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "983e77530b90e418e14e92bbc210c28eee77fedf642a0050e64d65809f54489b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "對這兩位女性，魯迅先生懷有真摯的敬意。",
      "output_sha256": "60488d61ca1e6c3eaee79bdabcc67fc57ca721662fd1dabb989ea76db695be11",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.398515,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b184226e2a9cfe75e75149192da4606a37e249611f95fcd92248847fe86055bd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "60488d61ca1e6c3eaee79bdabcc67fc57ca721662fd1dabb989ea76db695be11",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "魯迅先生的笑聲是明朗的，是從心裏的歡喜。",
      "output_sha256": "8cb1d6c5bb3f58b57aa0ee43fc48a26bf9cd86911fca9ba3190816c45383d03f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "8cb1d6c5bb3f58b57aa0ee43fc48a26bf9cd86911fca9ba3190816c45383d03f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "若有人說了什麼可笑的話，魯迅先生笑得連用菸捲都拿不住了，常常是笑得咳嗽起來。",
      "output_sha256": "b8e48d97184fc82718f83ff071a4169034241f7e8d4c1d41a874e0d24c75489a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "b8e48d97184fc82718f83ff071a4169034241f7e8d4c1d41a874e0d24c75489a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他只飲清茶，對咖啡、可可、牛奶、汽水等飲品毫不在意，家中也不備這些。",
      "output_sha256": "413a472aa07ef9a6ea30d923784ffa2fb92f24ffb2a1f44bd12a533ce2b1437e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.433559,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12,
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0459028c033465d9358a72a446327e58eb0bc203a62009547e5ca2d1f93c3933",
        "0743c083461c36b77c5cd19a709f2a7020885a2b348f9709b9c8c70017bb4efc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "413a472aa07ef9a6ea30d923784ffa2fb92f24ffb2a1f44bd12a533ce2b1437e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "魯迅先生的休息，不聽留聲機，不出去散步，也不倒在牀上睡覺。",
      "output_sha256": "78fd714c0110619f827ca8a70b9cbbd0a5df21da425f89ea70dea40eae3c5285",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "78fd714c0110619f827ca8a70b9cbbd0a5df21da425f89ea70dea40eae3c5285",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "魯迅先生自己說：",
      "output_sha256": "7a9cec2720e8376439fa2ec6014adc19d8003da4914b5df99c2cbd672c7f9f2b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "7a9cec2720e8376439fa2ec6014adc19d8003da4914b5df99c2cbd672c7f9f2b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“坐在椅子上翻一翻書就是休息了。”",
      "output_sha256": "c80def675df59740e0bd9a925c90c5917ee6a5b5fc001535d464bb08bb03727f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "c80def675df59740e0bd9a925c90c5917ee6a5b5fc001535d464bb08bb03727f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "老靶子路有一家小吃茶店，只有門面一間，在門面裏邊設座，座少，安靜，光線不充足，有些冷落。",
      "output_sha256": "c2ddce929a5190649d045c44523184a94b191a036960c2f14a577ab0ed97c99d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "c2ddce929a5190649d045c44523184a94b191a036960c2f14a577ab0ed97c99d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "魯迅先生經常光顧這家茶館，約會多半是在這裡進行，老闆是一位白俄，身材肥胖，中文大概聽不太懂。",
      "output_sha256": "a5302c4faf78eee71a6da5690316395fd60d6c9c302b5cbdc5eba8482fca229a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.573235,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18,
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "205685b2857ca2ea4cf17bbe1af04347264a97b373ede2db4db8dec6e30248e4",
        "bf6dffde58c0a2f2cd8fa3a60c1a8e562ae6ea0c637a309de4c7d216169536ce"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a5302c4faf78eee71a6da5690316395fd60d6c9c302b5cbdc5eba8482fca229a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "魯迅先生這一位老人，穿着布袍子，有時到這裏來，泡一壺紅茶，和青年人坐在一道談了一兩個鐘頭。",
      "output_sha256": "2afcb0935dd2751e9640aa08925d4cc57682db1cba12031a9255730ea5e3606d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "2afcb0935dd2751e9640aa08925d4cc57682db1cba12031a9255730ea5e3606d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有一天魯迅先生的背後那茶座裏邊坐着一位摩登女子，身穿紫裙子黃衣裳，頭戴花帽子……那女子臨走時，魯迅先生一看她，就用眼瞪着她，很生氣地看了她半天，而後說：",
      "output_sha256": "3f497e818a0bb806fed209b7031d032d0e22dff66ca2075bc1c7c82ddf616ef5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "3f497e818a0bb806fed209b7031d032d0e22dff66ca2075bc1c7c82ddf616ef5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“你是做什麼的呢？”",
      "output_sha256": "ac171ee764a8d54502bffbc9404272d7dfc36c0f61a69f94901eb1de8b7782ab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.861813,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "54eccc103c1ec29aefcf4fc92829c8c46d0b5a2b69251495aed8d7bdd436988b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ac171ee764a8d54502bffbc9404272d7dfc36c0f61a69f94901eb1de8b7782ab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "……”",
      "output_sha256": "62c54477d5f4b758b352528e545dc631462c65847edf4a2c7a993c4846b93aa6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "62c54477d5f4b758b352528e545dc631462c65847edf4a2c7a993c4846b93aa6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "魯迅先生對於穿着紫裙子，黃衣裳，花帽子的人就是這樣看法的。",
      "output_sha256": "31f4c79fb17f1a1c9dfd6092f145e25112443baf7bf27235790ebdf175de1473",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "31f4c79fb17f1a1c9dfd6092f145e25112443baf7bf27235790ebdf175de1473",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "鬼到底是有的沒有的？",
      "output_sha256": "1560b96935602e7018c1d081d442a7f5870db06752be0be0ed33197b99be20af",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "1560b96935602e7018c1d081d442a7f5870db06752be0be0ed33197b99be20af",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "傳說上有人見過，還跟鬼說過話，還有人被鬼在後面追趕過，有的稍微軟弱一點的鬼，一見了人就貼在牆上，但沒有一個人捉住一個鬼給大家看看。",
      "output_sha256": "c8be19564355af96ccdc55ec72a12446d409a4d527b744d92f43240285700b0f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "c8be19564355af96ccdc55ec72a12446d409a4d527b744d92f43240285700b0f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "魯迅先生講了他看見過鬼的故事給大家聽：",
      "output_sha256": "a360f428ebef8473316479c361ea8ae762affb905e3a1d390da59258425525ac",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "a360f428ebef8473316479c361ea8ae762affb905e3a1d390da59258425525ac",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“那是在紹興……”魯迅先生回憶道，“三十年前……”",
      "output_sha256": "935efd68f71a7dce66cbcfe0ac2e8e092916e713cc1b22ec988b7affdb2ea38c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.736384,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7d9973dd3501556d6f61febbc976f1cfcb64a4c5b15dafa09818dc8434f16b61"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "935efd68f71a7dce66cbcfe0ac2e8e092916e713cc1b22ec988b7affdb2ea38c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那時魯迅先生從日本讀書回來，在一個師範學堂裏也不知什麼學堂裏教書，晚上沒有事時，魯迅先生總是到朋友家去談天，這朋友住得離學堂幾里路，幾里路不算遠，但必得經過一片墳地，談天有的時候就談得晚了，十一二點鐘纔回學堂的事也常有。",
      "output_sha256": "6e312e900a1078b453df1eae7ecbcef108a52ff2292e46f17f50d51c80b27eec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "6e312e900a1078b453df1eae7ecbcef108a52ff2292e46f17f50d51c80b27eec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "某天，他回去的時候已經很晚，天上掛著一輪明月。",
      "output_sha256": "79354c618c649287447fba827693357f4bb764154b29b5cb82696d2707e79dca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.394135,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e38d49d531b13936ab0edacb378023935128b01d04d270bc8fc1be0959255b04"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "79354c618c649287447fba827693357f4bb764154b29b5cb82696d2707e79dca",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "當魯迅先生沿著歸路走去時，遠方突然出現一個白影。",
      "output_sha256": "732594ae5619df750e9babaaa00b1858d75e230aec44d9a43918b03e6eb1e93c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.502846,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c5afbbbc601156917cf117fdb7a39206e35825b83219f2c0d6bac6ee645c7fbb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "732594ae5619df750e9babaaa00b1858d75e230aec44d9a43918b03e6eb1e93c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "魯迅先生是不相信鬼的，在日本留學時是學的醫，常常把死人擡來解剖的，魯迅先生解剖過二十幾個，不但不怕鬼，對死人也不怕，所以對於墳地也就根本不怕，仍舊是向前走的。",
      "output_sha256": "b463530dc5007cc996ff16251b0187d488ab6dd5e8c909c85525da75cc1e8756",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "b463530dc5007cc996ff16251b0187d488ab6dd5e8c909c85525da75cc1e8756",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "走了幾步，那遠處的白東西沒有了，再看，突然又有了。",
      "output_sha256": "42a4275dab6ac52d9ee93390a121e68c8645864bf2bc6382c013a92a971d70c5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "42a4275dab6ac52d9ee93390a121e68c8645864bf2bc6382c013a92a971d70c5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "並且時小時大，時高時低，正和鬼一樣，鬼不就是變幻無常的嗎？",
      "output_sha256": "dac540bff33d63b787ffd4578a3b103d2e8f586700732596ed218f1918b389f8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "dac540bff33d63b787ffd4578a3b103d2e8f586700732596ed218f1918b389f8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "魯迅先生心中一陣猶豫，究竟是繼續前行，還是折返？",
      "output_sha256": "33c3ffd107988d4f674b272e79946f4ca6e6e80cfac7061d49e380f3d7a78fa6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.402824,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35,
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b4e96709682e92212d04da65e2d4a321688a659b237f63fa905c0bf99112d6f6",
        "a682e0734d33930a1509fcc11a5d08eab47fd73940aeb8060cea19d7d829b33a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "33c3ffd107988d4f674b272e79946f4ca6e6e80cfac7061d49e380f3d7a78fa6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "事實上，回校不只這一條路，這不過是最近的一條而已。",
      "output_sha256": "a86acd002169b3c68a66b428d5da20637907bb85d209ec45de62f7e3ad2ee643",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.626304,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2d2c62c4e5df38f8a859bfe329dd479f36952d16189fe3fbb2f70a2451ffe814"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a86acd002169b3c68a66b428d5da20637907bb85d209ec45de62f7e3ad2ee643",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "魯迅先生仍是向前走的，到底要看一看鬼是什麼樣，雖然那時候也怕了。",
      "output_sha256": "b6b7607a3d9e8abe144e71e1ee1ddef18c9acac2fbe6e7fdeb3e675f1b05b9b7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "b6b7607a3d9e8abe144e71e1ee1ddef18c9acac2fbe6e7fdeb3e675f1b05b9b7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "魯迅先生那時從日本回來不久，所以還穿着硬底皮鞋，魯迅先生決心要給那鬼一個致命的打擊。",
      "output_sha256": "be6a6ebe172c883931b2a2a45a8b52e3c9f2a8cbb2a066b77f7200ff54272ff9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "be6a6ebe172c883931b2a2a45a8b52e3c9f2a8cbb2a066b77f7200ff54272ff9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "等走到那白影旁邊時，那白影縮小了，蹲下了，一聲不響地靠住了一個墳堆。",
      "output_sha256": "193764cc6a1962c8ad18a1f2a0baba947baba0f95055888f1447be38525dd001",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "193764cc6a1962c8ad18a1f2a0baba947baba0f95055888f1447be38525dd001",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "魯迅先生就用了他的硬皮鞋踢出去。",
      "output_sha256": "f03b9d81eda4539da291119f4bf1a25f8bd34061ff97857e87cdfc5425e59082",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "f03b9d81eda4539da291119f4bf1a25f8bd34061ff97857e87cdfc5425e59082",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那白影噢的一聲叫出來，隨着就站起來。",
      "output_sha256": "473968f089808878a9135cd8789478a3f30d2aba0f2a95afb4b26b7a8871a0f9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "473968f089808878a9135cd8789478a3f30d2aba0f2a95afb4b26b7a8871a0f9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "魯迅先生仔細一看，原來是一個人。",
      "output_sha256": "5f2bb4dc8c876bb40b0df9ba95d10217554c3b33eac9e1f0217c93d4561f5dc9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": 0.534524,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8b2191405695eedcaeedd3a9e51b10020926bda3be3cd84edbcd83bb938b0e20"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5f2bb4dc8c876bb40b0df9ba95d10217554c3b33eac9e1f0217c93d4561f5dc9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他回憶起踢的那一瞬，心中懷著恐懼，似乎若不將那東西踢死，自己反而會遭殃，因此全力以赴。",
      "output_sha256": "6b93a470a442607ddfc384ede7088e8178e3ebb51511f72a0686681751192dfa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": 0.450311,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "89e8102b1dc0979143d6a9d042a64cc8abe133f901a22815b6b22bd51803f72a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6b93a470a442607ddfc384ede7088e8178e3ebb51511f72a0686681751192dfa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "原來是一個盜墓子的人在墳場上半夜做着工作。",
      "output_sha256": "953146eec0c957bc5abba0af021dff91e7e670d7ed6c1351f6610353adb9e219",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "953146eec0c957bc5abba0af021dff91e7e670d7ed6c1351f6610353adb9e219",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 30,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "魯迅先生說到這裏就笑了起來。",
      "output_sha256": "4bc4a364e08d05d3c141f7038bc2c226d5f2292bc7ecd043df9b521ac4f834ad",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "4bc4a364e08d05d3c141f7038bc2c226d5f2292bc7ecd043df9b521ac4f834ad",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 31,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“鬼也是怕踢的，踢他一腳立刻就變成人了。”",
      "output_sha256": "6339d4d9bbcb74f1287a89c1d329c5d652ef05ea3d1e819ced1fb4eb35bca2a0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "6339d4d9bbcb74f1287a89c1d329c5d652ef05ea3d1e819ced1fb4eb35bca2a0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 32,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我想，若是鬼常常讓魯迅先生踢踢，倒是件好事，因為這給了他一個做人的機會。",
      "output_sha256": "5882127f78eead3539d84d31d95c268f95c2c1f544a25b3ffeae46417584fed9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
